    "name": "Genome annotation with Maker (update)",
    "readme": "This workflow is used for the GTN \u201cGenome annotation with Maker\u201d (https://training.galaxyproject.org/training-material/topics/genome-annotation/tutorials/annotation-with-maker/tutorial.html).\n\n\nMaker is a tool for annotating genomic sequences. In this tutorial, you will learn how to annotate a genome and assess its quality, while discovering the importance of training ab initio predictors to achieve optimal results.",
    "report": {
